the text of the source program is at "sources/eligibility-rule.l4".

an applicant is eligible if
    the applicant is at least 18 years old
    and the applicant has shown valid identification.

an applicant is at least 18 years old if
    the age of the applicant >= 18.

an applicant has shown valid identification if
    the applicant has valid ID.

